F40E   E3 C4                  ADDD   ,U   
F410   ED C4        ST:       STD   ,U   
F412   39                     RTS      
F413                             ; "-" has two jobs: directly before a digit it starts a negative number.
F413   BD F0 BB     H_SUB:    JSR   isdig   
F416   25 2C                  BLO   negnum   
F418   EC 42                  LDD   2,U   
F41A   A3 C1                  SUBD   ,U++   
